stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> PENDING: Requester creates consent request
    PENDING --> ACCEPTED_BY_BOTH: Recipient accepts
    PENDING --> DECLINED: Recipient declines
    PENDING --> CANCELLED: Participant cancels
    PENDING --> EXPIRED: Admin/system expiry

    ACCEPTED_BY_BOTH --> AWAITING_EXTERNAL_AUTHORIZATION: Admin starts simulated gate
    ACCEPTED_BY_BOTH --> CANCELLED: Participant cancels
    ACCEPTED_BY_BOTH --> EXPIRED: Admin/system expiry

    AWAITING_EXTERNAL_AUTHORIZATION --> COMPLETED: Admin completes simulation
    AWAITING_EXTERNAL_AUTHORIZATION --> CANCELLED: Participant cancels

    DECLINED --> [*]
    CANCELLED --> [*]
    COMPLETED --> [*]
    EXPIRED --> [*]

    note right of ACCEPTED_BY_BOTH
        Consent exists only inside this
        prototype. It is not official
        railway authorization.
    end note

    note right of COMPLETED
        Terminal simulated state.
        No real reservation is changed.
    end note
